BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:House Of Lambda Presents: Noche Latina!
DTSTART:20260417T213000
DTEND:20260417T213000
UID:80def73c4eb90fe157b0b4978bbca1e5@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to watch amazing performances &amp\; dance and vibe 
 all night with the hottest Latin beats and good vibes at House Of Lambda! 
 House of Lambda invite you to an exclusive $trip club experience created f
 or and by queer people . Welcome to the House Of Lambda\, where safety\, s
 olidarity\, and celebration reign supreme. We are carving out a sanctuary 
 in Toronto’s vibrant queer community. Pioneers of Toronto’a very first
  queer strip event\, were no strangers to breaking boundaries and creating
  groundbreaking experiences. These events are all 19+. House Of Lambda is 
 a $trip Club experience for sapphic/queer people only. As attendees please
  be prepared to tip the dancers/bar staff like any regular $trip club esta
 blishment and to show your appreciation for their service! No cis men will
  be allowed in upon entry. So come join us for a night of fun and exciteme
 nt at the House Of Lambda. Get ready to experience a unique blend of queer
  entertainment\, queer culture\, erotic and uncensored live queer entertai
 nment\, music and good vibes. This in-person event promises to be a memora
 ble one\, filled with surprises and great company🫶🏼 Things To Consid
 er! 🚨🚨🚨 This event is for women\, non-binary\, two-spirited\, tra
 ns babes only! 🚫No cis-men are permitted entry! 🚫 We have a zero tol
 erance policy for homophobia\, transphobia\, racism\, harassment or violen
 ce of any kind. This event is a safe\, sex positive space for all who iden
 tify as lesbian\, women\, trans women\, and non-binary folks under the tra
 ns-feminine spectrum. 🎟️There will be tickets available at the door f
 or purchase for $30. We do recommend getting tickets online to ensure your
  spot\, due to having a capacity at the venue. Online tickets are also onl
 y $20. Hurry you won’t want to miss this! 📸No cameras\, only memories
 . In order to provide privacy for you and the dancers we kindly ask to ref
 rain from using your cellphones while inside the club. We will have an ons
 ite photographer taking pictures and videos at our photo booth area if you
  want your pictures taken! 🏧The ATM has a fee of 10%. If you chose not 
 to use the ATM we have a cash back option which has a 20% fee. We recommen
 d coming with cash ahead of time. 💸💸💸 Want to make it rain??? We 
 also offer American $1 for sale. 🥵If want to make it a V.I.P. Experienc
 e with your favourite dancers\, we provide private rooms. 🍾 V.I.P. Bott
 le Service Available: Booth seating with the best views of the stage Extra
  attention from the dancers Dedicated server 🍽️ Hungry for a snack\, 
 we have a kitchen with a full menu to choose from\, just ask the servers! 
 🎤 Mc for the night is Loli Fantasia! 🎁 We will have awesome prizes f
 or our games &amp\; giveaway portion that will take place during our inter
 mission. 💃🪩During intermissions from the performances\, we encourage
  to spend some time with your favourite dancers in V.I.P. or use the stage
  as your own personal stage to show off your moves. We will end the night 
 with a dance party with our in house DJ!!! Step into a world of indulgence
 \, mystery and eroticism uncensored performances\, sensual beats\, and una
 pologetic Sapphic energy. This is not your average night out\, this is a s
 pace to celebrate Sapphic pleasure\, community\, and power✨🌈 Expect g
 ravity-defying performances\, surprises\, special guests\,giveaways and pu
 re Sapphic energy. Come curious. Leave changed! Tag your friends\, grab yo
 ur tickets\, and don’t miss out on this unforgettable night! 💋 ‍
LOCATION:The House of Lancaster\, 1215 Bloor St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/house-of-lambda-presents-noche-latina
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Veneno 4 Year Anniversary ♡
DTSTART:20260417T220000
DTEND:20260417T220000
UID:c2bf2d2304fa6f921d702fcbcfbb6fa8@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:EVERYBODY SAY FELIZ CUMPLE VENENO! We&#x27\;re throwing a part
 y to celebrate 4 years of this dancefloor we loove! It&#x27\;s been over 1
 65 hours of dancing with the best crowd: YOU ♡ In charge of making you d
 ance will be DJ Sueño from México and your beloved locals who you know a
 nd love: Momocita\, Sofia Fly\, Ana Luisa and mo.fede. Será una noche cl
 ásica de reggaetón\, dembow\, cumbiatón y demás música para tus cader
 as\, para que te ganes el premio de la que más baila en nuestra fiesta de
  cumpleeee °°°°°°° DJ Sueño is a pillar of the underground and a l
 egend of Mexican reggaeton. Internationally recognized as a DJ of Old Scho
 ol Reggaeton\, underground producer\, and MC\, he co-founded Perreo Pesado
  in 2016 alongside Rosa Pistola and DJ Krizis\, with the mission of amplif
 ying the sound frequencies of their barrios worldwide. His musical line bl
 ends Puerto Rico’s old school reggaeton\, Mexican cumbiatón\, and under
 ground reggaeton from the streets of Mexico\, establishing him as one of t
 he most influential figures in the Latin underground. Additional info: ☆
  Door tickets will be limited and subject to capacity ☆ Veneno is a spac
 e is for the QTBIPOC &amp\; Latin American communities first\, but open to
  anyone who is committed to consent and to having a respectful good time o
 n the dancefloor. ☆ This venue is only partially accessible. Reach out t
 o us via instagram @venen_0 if you have any questions. ☆ Coat check migh
 t be available depending on the weather ☆ 19+ please bring your physical
 \, valid ID ☆ No refunds. You can add your ticket to the resale queue\, 
 and once the event sells out your tickets will go on sale. ‍
LOCATION:Cafeteria\, 1650 Dupont Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/veneno-4-year-anniversary
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
