UID:b8eb1bf5883f705435749b04c8f8708c@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Come rock away to Caribbean love chunes all night with us from
  lovers rock &amp\; groovy soca to bedroom dancehall &amp\; zouk/kompa\, e
 tc! WINE DUNG!: FUH DI LOVAHS w/ DJs TANGERINE\, SOUNDBOI\, &amp\; TRINIDA
 DDY! HELLO BABES! WINE DUNG IS BACK! Did you miss us? We missed you! Come 
 reunite with us on Friday\, April 17th from 10 PM to 2 AM at Three Dollar 
 Bill in Parkdale! This is FUH DI LOVAHS! Love day is every day... whether 
 you&#x27\;re partnered\, single\, or looking\, this event is for you if yo
 u love all the romantic and sexy chunes our cultures create and provide. O
 ur people know how to muse about love\, so why not come together and sing 
 our hearts out? Rock away to love chunes from all over the Caribbean diasp
 ora (lovers rock\, groovy soca\, bedroom dancehall\, zouk\, kompa\, etc...
 ) and start off our 2026 season basking in together\, and with a few of th
 e best queer Caribbean DJs in the city. All batty gyals\, bais\, dey/dems\
 , famalay and hawt babes gender non-specific or conforming welcome! Bring 
 yuh flags &amp\; fans (cause it gets HOT) - rep your country\, your sexual
 ity\, and your gender if you&#x27\;d like. All of those flags are welcome 
 in this space! SELECTAHS: TANGERINE (@tangerineplzz) SOUNDBOI (@king.charm
 ing9) TRINIDADDY (@trinixdaddy) $10-20 per ticket sliding scale online thr
 ough Eventbrite. Few tickets will be available at the door $20-25 sliding 
 scale - please try and buy in advance since space is very limited\, and ti
 cket holders will be prioritized for entry before 11 PM. Entry is based on
  capacity after 11 PM for ticket holders and people hoping to buy tickets 
 at the door. Event is 19+\, IDs will be checked and bags will be checked a
 t the door. Every queer person is welcome in this space\, and we ask that 
 everyone stay mindful and respectful of this being a BIPOC and queer Carib
 bean centred event. This means QTBIPOC\, and especially queer and trans Ca
 ribbean folks\, to the front! There will be pictures and videos taken at t
 he event by the organizer and their official photographer\, and the media 
 taken by us can be used for future promo of Wine Dung events. All funds ma
 de from this event will firstly go towards paying the DJs\, organizer\, ph
 otographer\, and door workers for their time &amp\; craft\, and secondly t
 owards sustaining future Wine Dung events. All involved are QTBIPOC\, so p
 lease pay what you can! Please reach out to the organizer (Mars AKA DJ TRI
 NIDADDY) through Instagram (@winedung.to) or e-mail (winedung.to@gmail.com
 ) with any questions or concerns &lt\;3 Come slow dance with your baby\, b
 estie\, famalay\, a new cutie\, or by yourself - love is everywhere\, in e
 very way\, and in abundance. So let&#x27\;s share it &lt\;3 See you there!
  MWAH! &lt\;3 Organizer: Mars Ramlogan\, DJ TRINIDADDY ‍
LOCATION:Three Dollar Bill\, 1592 Queen Street West
