SUMMARY:Toronto Leatherqueer Picnic
DTSTART:20260418T140000
DTEND:20260418T140000
UID:39cf37db93fe9905927d8a717472f7d3@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Guess who’s baaaack? Toronto Leatherqueer Picnic Saturday Ap
 ril 18\, 2-5pm. *If it’s raining\, we’ll reschedule for the following 
 Saturday\, April 25. This is a space for leatherqueers of marginalized gen
 ders to connect\, make friends\, and cruise. Flagging is encouraged! We wi
 ll have optional name tags and icebreaker prompts to help folks mingle com
 fortably. We’ll gather in the southwest corner of the park\, near Banjar
 a. Look for the Leather Pride flag to find us! This spot in the park is mi
 xed sun and shade and has flat\, uneven grassy ground. If you like\, bring
  yourself a camp chair\, picnic blanket\, pillow\, snacks\, whatever you
 ’d like to have to enjoy a nice afternoon in the park. Let’s be comfor
 table! A note on C0v1D: the limited data we have makes it difficult to ass
 ess the severity of this ongoing pandemic. Let’s practice caring safety 
 protocols and give each other ample space. Bring a mask in case you want t
 o get closer to skill-share or cruise etc. *If someone is wearing a mask\,
  wear one to approach them.* If you have any symptoms of illness or known/
 suspected recent exposures\, please don’t come. Let’s make sure we hav
 e a healthy tomorrow to meet again in the future. Christie Pits is at 750 
 Bloor St W in Toronto. It is accessible by car with street and lot parking
  nearby\, by subway via Line 2 at Christie station and by bus via route 12
 6. There are two\, gendered\, wheelchair-accessible washrooms at the botto
 m of a steep hill with a paved path. Your organizers are @hollys_horny_hom
 e @pansybutch &amp\; @thekikikennedy. Inspired by similar gatherings acros
 s turtle island\, with acknowledgement &amp\; appreciation to @mother.arch
 etype &amp\; @_wolfsmilk._ .\, @monster_femme\, @sharonpinkishere\, @daemo
 numx\, @chicagoleatherdykepicnic\, and many others. ‍
LOCATION:Christie Pits Park\, 750 Bloor Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/toronto-leatherqueer-picnic
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
