BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Spring MEGA Book Swap
DTSTART:20260425T130000
DTEND:20260425T130000
UID:286df1136e6124937ef69685e26036f6@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:The Mega Book Swap is a place for everyone to get books for fr
 ee or cheap. The Mega Book Swap is a place to get books for free or cheap.
  You swap your books for tickets you can use to trade for books. Even thou
 gh Glad Day’s focus is 2SLGBTQ books\, this Book Swap is for everyone an
 d (almost) every kind of book! Every book &#x27\;costs&#x27\; one ticket. 
 Why RSVP or Prepay for Tickets RSVP for FREE in Eventbrite and get entered
  into a draw to win 10 tickets! This helps us in our event planning. Prepa
 y for 3 tickets and skip any lines Want to prepay for tickets and skip the
  line? Get 3 tickets for $10 in advance and we absorb the Eventbrite &amp\
 ; credit card fees for you :) Tickets will be held under your name. You AL
 SO get entered in a draw to win 10 more tickets! Timing: 12:30pm -Trading 
 Books for Tickets starts 1pm - Ticket Mega Swap in the Atrium starts 5pm -
  Last chance to trade in your books for tickets 6pm - Everything ends TWO 
 WAYS TO SWAP! There are two ways to swap: Ticket Mega Swap (this is for 10
 0s of books in the big Atrium space) Chaos Lounge Swap (trade with actual 
 people in the lounge) MEGA TICKET SWAP : How it works You get tickets and 
 you swap your ticket for a book from the big book zone that will have over
  400 books in it! The books will ‘cost’ just one ticket. There will be
  tables spread out in the large Atrium and books will be grouped roughly i
 nto areas like “Fiction”\, “Memoir”\, “Children’s” &quot\;Fr
 ench&quot\;\, &quot\;Health&quot\;. How to get tickets: You can BUY TICKET
 S You can buy 1 ticket for $5 or 3 tickets for $10 or You can SWAP BOOKS F
 OR TICKETS 3 books gets you 1 ticket 5 books gets you 2 tickets 10 books g
 ets you 5 tickets Over 10 books get you 1 ticket for every 2 books (see be
 low for what books will not be accepted and which might get you extra tick
 ets) Note: We expect there may be a 5-10 minute line to exchange your book
 s for tickets\, so come early and avoid the line. Some limits on what book
 s can be swapped: You can swap almost any kind of book that is in decent c
 ondition. It can be in rough shape but we won’t accept anything with mol
 d\, water damage or yucky to touch. Also\, the following books will not be
  accepted for tickets: Dictionaries or textbooks Reference books that are 
 over 5 years old Outdated non-fiction like travel guides\, health advice a
 nd self-help that are over 5 years old Magazines (unless they are xxx maga
 zines - we love those!) And these books will get you more tickets than nor
 mal (like 1 to 3 tickets per book) Queer books by BIPOC authors Children
 ’s books with 2SLGBTQ content Trans books that are less than 10 years ol
 d Photography books Erotica Accessibility The entrance\, space and washroo
 ms are wheelchair accessible. ‍
LOCATION:Glad Day (32 Lisgar)\, 32 Lisgar
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/spring-mega-book-swap
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
