 ting LA-via-Montreal producer CFCF has amassed a diverse and thought-provo
 king catalog over the past 15 years\, moving across genres from balearic d
 isco to kitschy drum’n’bass\, and culminating in the dizzying alt-elec
 tronica opus ‘Memoryland’ in 2021. His follow-up\, ‘L.U.V.’ is due
  this June\, once again evolving his sound toward glitzy dancepop and elec
 troclash\, as evidenced on first singles “ultra-obscene!” featuring Ar
