DESCRIPTION:FISHTANK launched in 2025\, alongside the reopening of Toronto
 ’s Boutique\, as monthly party showcasing the best up and coming Toronto
  queer house DJs as well as many classic ones who helped create scene. Now
  in 2026\, Fishtank relaunches at buddies as a full scale event! With resi
 dents Prince Batrick + Delicious + LArA at the helm\, Fishtank explores th
 e history of gay house music ranging from handbag house\, Latin house and 
 tribal house all the way to ballroom and circuit. This goal is to cultivat
 e an environment reminiscent of clubs such as Sound Factory and Twilo as w
 ell as old school style circuit parties. Joining as headliners for this re
 launch is Michael Magnan from New York (Battle Hymn Resident) and LEGENDAR
 Y DJ Black Cat from Toronto. Come early\, and make sure to stay late for a
 t 2:30\, when Fishtank becomes Fishtank-after-Dark\, with amore moody\, se
 xy house gay house sound to finish the night all the way to our extended 4
  am last call. Are you ready to get wet? Come swim with us. ‍
LOCATION:Buddies in Bad Times\, 12 Alexander St
